sequenceDiagram
  participant App as Business Flow
  participant Backend as Connector Backend
  participant Endpoint as Outbound Endpoint Resolver
  participant Delivery as Outbound Delivery
  participant Queue as Queue Worker
  participant API as External API

  App->>Backend: queue_outbound_delivery(...)
  Backend->>Endpoint: get_outbound_endpoint(code_suffix)
  Endpoint->>Delivery: Create queued delivery
  Delivery->>Queue: Enqueue send job
  Queue->>Backend: _handle_outbound_webhook_delivery(...)

  alt Backend allows send
    Queue->>API: Dispatch HTTP request
    API-->>Queue: Response or timeout
    Queue->>Backend: _handle_outbound_webhook_response(...)
    Queue->>Delivery: Mark done, retry, or dead_letter
  else Backend returns terminal outcome
    Queue->>Delivery: Apply done, retry, cancel, or dead_letter
  end
